    "了解账号、内容和推送信息如何处理，以及如何管理权限和申请删除。": {
      "comment": "Compliance.swift:13",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "了解账号、内容和推送信息如何处理，以及如何管理权限和申请删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "瞭解帳號、內容和推送資訊如何處理，以及如何管理權限和申請刪除。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Learn how account, content and notification information is handled, and how to manage permissions and request deletion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "了解账号使用、内容权利、服务边界，以及举报和申诉方式。": {
      "comment": "Compliance.swift:14",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "了解账号使用、内容权利、服务边界，以及举报和申诉方式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "瞭解帳號使用、內容權利、服務邊界，以及舉報和申訴方式。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Learn about account use, content rights, service limitations, reports and appeals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尊重他人的隐私与交往意愿；发现骚扰、侵权或违法内容时，可以举报或屏蔽。": {
      "comment": "Compliance.swift:15",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尊重他人的隐私与交往意愿；发现骚扰、侵权或违法内容时，可以举报或屏蔽。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尊重他人的隱私與交往意願；發現騷擾、侵權或違法內容時，可以舉報或封鎖。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Respect others’ privacy and boundaries. Report or block harassment, infringement or illegal content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
